```

### Open Redirect
```bash
cat urls.txt | grep -E "(url|redirect|next|return|goto)=http" | qsreplace "https://evil.com" | while read url; do
    curl -s -L "$url" -I | grep -i "evil.com" && echo "VULN: $url"
done
```

### Subdomain Takeover
```bash
